title: Solstica Kalendaro
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the proposal document it implements.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Plaza Alonso
    given-names: Javier
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3908-3759
abstract: >-
  Android application showing the Gregorian calendar and the Solstica Kalendaro
  side by side, with a bidirectional date converter and the seasonal structure
  of the proposed calendar.
license: MIT
